//  assets/manifest.json (edit the manifest, not this file).
//
//  Keys (also the keys of captions.ini, written "section.key"):
//    title, character
//    rank.1 .. rank.7                       rank names by total visits (1,2,3,4,5,6-7,8+)
//    tier.0 .. tier.3, tier.N_color         outcome names + colours (#RRGGBB)
//    bowl.common|rare|legend (+ _color, _shape = circle|triangle|star)
//    color.1 .. color.6 (+ color.N_hex)     crystal colour names / colour specs: "#RRGGBB",
//                                           2-4 stops "#RRGGBB,#RRGGBB" (cycled) or "rainbow";
//                                           in use = 1..N up to the first empty N_hex
//    caption.<cue>                          one-to-three-word captions per cue
//    ui.*                                   fixed interface words
//    meter.*, fx.*, glow.idle_color         story features (manifest.schema.md)
//    nobutton.<key>                         used instead of <key> when [station] button = no
//    nobutton.voice                         "from=to;..." voice group / line swaps (no button)
// ============================================================================

